 Product search for catalog-search.

 Queries are built for a parameterized driver: every value from the request goes in the params array and the SQL carries only $1, $2 placeholders. Never interpolate request values into the SQL string. See src/query.js.
+
+## Free-text search
+
+A term searches the product name with ILIKE. The whitelist of sort orders lives in src/sort.js.
+
+## Paging
+
+limitOffset(page, pageSize) clamps the page size to 1 to 100 and returns a limit and offset. Page numbers are 1-based.
